Bundled fonts
-------------

The web UI (`ui/`) bundles two typefaces so the canvas loads with no external
request — no CDN, no Google Fonts, nothing that leaks that you opened it. The
`.woff2` files are emitted into `ui/dist/assets/` by the build and ship inside
the released package.

